! Synthetic FullProf resolution file (invented numbers): the Gaussian variance is negative at short and at long d
!  Type of profile function: back-to-back exponentials * pseudo-Voigt
NPROF 9
!       Tof-min(us)    step      Tof-max(us)
TOFRG    7500 8.0 50000
!       Zero     Dtt1        Dtt2
ZD2TOF   20.0 15000.0 18.0
!     TOF-TWOTH of the bank
TWOTH    43.0
!       Sig-2     Sig-1     Sig-0
SIGMA    -4.0 30.0 -10.0
!       Gam-2     Gam-1     Gam-0
GAMMA    13.0 0.0 6.0
!          alph0       beta0       alph1       beta1
ALFBE    4.5 0.5 5.0 0.002
END
